T* (chariot-commanders looked upon their monarch with heavy hearts. Prime Minister Sumantra bowed his head, sensing the) Tj
T* (unspoken ache that had hollowed the king’s majesty. Dasharatha leaned forward, gripping the carved ivory arms of his) Tj
T* (throne, his fingers whitening as he looked upon his preceptor. The silence in the hall was suffocating, broken only by the soft) Tj
T* (flutter of royal peacocks outside the terrace.) Tj
